原愛（微博@福原愛AiFukuhara）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福原愛（微博@福原愛AiFukuhara）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240929/917194536118128640096318.png/XepGimXdfkJWQiSca3rPCk3I1Av8UwdW0WX2H9Fl9h8\"/><figcaption>福原愛（微博@福原愛AiFukuhara）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福原愛（微博@福原愛AiFukuhara）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240929/917194537326088192951386.png/KIfMQH1HnkSzFZSMD3L3Wy5ZFZHAA9kme4JL4nuCS-I\"/><figcaption>福原愛（微博@福原愛AiFukuhara）</figcaption></figure><p>福原愛副教授職位沒丟！消失1年重返大學開課</p><p>福原愛被虧「一輩子小三命」！她認了：想拿別人的</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:19:34.575027+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1446,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:35.508490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:17:40.661600+00:00","content_hash":"38840a4742ae071dca1be49e1d1744c1565f63e4e390f78448494e1106d47242","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}